                        sm   sigma[j]                      (s+1)m
    +------------------+-----------------------------------+-----------------+
src |  already copied  |  ?  | ... |  ?  | done|  ?  | done|                 |
    +------------------+-----------------------------------+-----------------+
         ^   |                  |
        p|   |invp              +-----------------+
         |   V                                    V
    +------------------+-----------------------------------+-----------------+
dst |  already copied  |     |     |     |     | ... |     |                 |
    +------------------+-----------------------------------+-----------------+
